# ROMs — nunca commitear
*.n64
*.z64
*.v64
rom/

# Recompiler output (generated)
RecompiledFuncs/
RecompiledPatches/
rsp/*.cpp
rsp/*.h

# Build output
build*/
out/
*.o
*.obj

# Cached known-good binaries for fast before/after comparison (see
