known_good_builds/

# Tool binaries (copied in by bootstrap.sh)
/N64Recomp
/RSPRecomp
/N64Btd

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
# ^ the hook config is the enforcement layer (check_ledger + guard_bash);
#   without it a clone has the scripts but nothing that runs them.


# Local state
config/rt64.*.json
portable.txt
scripts/__pycache__/
.cache/
symbols/sinpunishment.syms.toml.orig

# Debug/session logs from the auto-fix scripts (not source)
scripts/*.log


# Public tree. The development notes ARE published -- the findings ledger and the
# diagnostic playbook are the most interesting artifacts in this repo, and hiding
# them left the landing page as the only visible work.
#
# Two exceptions stay local:
#   * session handoffs -- working scratch, no value to a reader
#   * the raw journal -- 5,500 chronological lines that still record several
#     conclusions later overturned, WITHOUT marking which. The ledger exists
#     precisely because that file cannot be read safely. Publishing it would
#     hand a reader confident statements that are known to be wrong.
HANDOFF-*.md
docs/boot-debugging-*.md
docs/.route-state.json
# Build snapshots live on the second drive (see scripts/build.sh); this is a symlink.
known_good_builds
